stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: Confirmation Created
    
    PENDING --> CONFIRMED: Seller Confirms Match
    PENDING --> REJECTED: Seller Rejects Match
    PENDING --> EXPIRED: Timeout (24h)
    
    CONFIRMED --> [*]: Product Merged
    REJECTED --> [*]: New Product Created
    EXPIRED --> [*]: Auto Create New Product
    
    note right of PENDING
        Seller has 24 hours
        to respond
    end note
    
    note right of CONFIRMED
        Seller offer linked
        to existing product
    end note
    
    note right of REJECTED
        New catalog entry
        created
    end note
    
    note right of EXPIRED
        Default action:
        create new product
    end note
